flowchart TD
    A[SPV creates product] --> B[Operator creates RCV with expected SKU quantities]
    B --> C[Operator submits TRX actual physical quantities]
    C --> D{RCV incomplete and no active TRX?}
    D -- No --> E[Return validation or conflict error]
    D -- Yes --> F{Every actual quantity within remaining approved-based cap?}
    F -- No --> G[Persist REJECTED_BY_SYSTEM / UNRESOLVED]
    G --> H[HTTP 201 persisted attempt; SPV investigates]
    H --> I{Input error?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Correct same TRX/RCV IDs; actor/time/reason and before-after audit]
    J --> F
    I -- No --> K[Record verified physical discrepancy and resolve review]
    K --> C
    F -- Yes --> L[Persist PENDING_APPROVAL]
    L --> M[SPV approves]
    M --> N[Single PostgreSQL transaction: revalidate, ledger, balance, approval, audit, outbox]
    N --> O{All SKU expected quantities approved?}
    O -- Yes --> P[RCV COMPLETED]
    O -- No --> Q[RCV INCOMPLETE: next TRX permitted]
    Q --> C
    N --> R[Outbox publisher]
    R --> S[RabbitMQ]
    S --> T[Consumer persists notification once per source_event_id and recipient_id]
    T --> U[React polls notifications via REST]
